{"questions":[{"question":"Kva blir $3x + 2x - x$ forenkla?","options":["$4x$","$5x$","$6x$","$4x^3$"],"explanation":"Vi samlar like ledd: $3x + 2x - x = (3+2-1)x = 4x$."},{"question":"Kva blir $2(x + 3) - 4$?","options":["$2x + 2$","$2x + 6$","$2x - 1$","$2x + 10$"],"explanation":"Vi multipliserer inn: $2x + 6 - 4 = 2x + 2$."},{"question":"Kva er $x \\cdot x \\cdot x$ skrive som potens?","options":["$x^3$","$3x$","$x^2$","$3^x$"],"explanation":"Tre like faktorar multipliserte gir $x^3$."},{"question":"Kva blir $5a - (2a - 3)$?","options":["$3a + 3$","$3a - 3$","$7a - 3$","$3a + 5$"],"explanation":"Minusteiknet snur forteikna i parentesen: $5a - 2a + 3 = 3a + 3$."},{"question":"Kva er verdien av $2x^2$ når $x = 3$?","options":["$18$","$36$","$12$","$6$"],"explanation":"Vi reknar potensen først: $2 \\cdot 3^2 = 2 \\cdot 9 = 18$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"1d0d7d35c470aca5","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:18:41.497Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":26,"tm":{"9510aa5ac35c2dc5":"Kva blir $3x + 2x - x$ forenkla?","9d6674c52616c0f3":"$4x$","105b18529cab58d5":"$5x$","82f5f079ede25c0a":"$6x$","3cf6659151272471":"$4x^3$","cab25f7abf08d71e":"Vi samlar like ledd: $3x + 2x - x = (3+2-1)x = 4x$.","e3c17955a1b97e6d":"Kva blir $2(x + 3) - 4$?","61649d39f1ed7ff5":"$2x + 2$","ab38681ea5689a97":"$2x + 6$","5f8ac0a4dad1a8bf":"$2x - 1$","3cfb4261fcae5461":"$2x + 10$","dcdc1c5dbbb80657":"Vi multipliserer inn: $2x + 6 - 4 = 2x + 2$.","e12f7c2f8f3fe621":"Kva er $x \\cdot x \\cdot x$ skrive som potens?","f7622630b2d61c0b":"$x^3$","e2fe3bdcb9849f47":"$3x$","7f408224ea7b716f":"$x^2$","0872e88b2a5b0a96":"$3^x$","329c6f5c23cf83c8":"Tre like faktorar multipliserte gir $x^3$.","98e7c32b3486ad16":"Kva blir $5a - (2a - 3)$?","4edb588d24d17015":"$3a + 3$","a132ec252574ab24":"$3a - 3$","30b3a6d7550ff7d9":"$7a - 3$","7ea35cd6a9ead632":"$3a + 5$","9a7acfb790264d8f":"Minusteiknet snur forteikna i parentesen: $5a - 2a + 3 = 3a + 3$.","08abecc87bb4c76f":"Kva er verdien av $2x^2$ når $x = 3$?","dc635b7